TAVL-Syn source release

This distribution reorganizes an existing conditional Rectified Flow implementation
with Transport-Aware Velocity Steering and Damped Self-Correction. The existing
GNU General Public License version 2 text is retained without modification.
No new license or third-party copyright ownership is asserted by this cleanup.

Neural-network parameter names and the legacy checkpoint protocol identifiers are
retained for compatibility. Dataset images, patient identifiers, trained weights,
experimental outputs, and workstation-specific configuration are not distributed.

PyTorch, NumPy, SciPy, NiBabel, Pillow, scikit-image, and tqdm are external
dependencies governed by their respective licenses. Dataset permissions and
appropriate scientific citations remain separate from the source-code license.
